{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"rejectionReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","text":"AsyncStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/RejectionReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV","text":"RejectionReport"},{"kind":"text","text":"> { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker’s worker checks each event’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"constraintViolation()"},{"type":"text","text":" before anything else, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rejected event is never enriched, held by a consent, written to a store or delivered. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"record a store recovered is checked too, and one rejected is forgotten by the store. In"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"debug builds each rejection is also logged at error level."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a rejection joins the waiting report of the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event, property and keyword, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reports waiting unread are at most one per constraint the app declares, however many events"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"break them. Copies of a tracker share one sequence, which has one consumer and ends once the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker has finished. A "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp"},{"type":"text","text":" tracker’s is empty."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/rejectionreports"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker rejected because a property broke a constraint declared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on it, in the order the rejections happen."}],"metadata":{"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L214","fileName":"Tracker.swift"},"title":"rejectionReports","roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV16rejectionReportsScSyAA15RejectionReportVGvp","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rejectionReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"RejectionReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]},"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/rejectionReports":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker rejected because a property broke a constraint declared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on it, in the order the rejections happen."}],"r